WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,120
Husband

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,460
You said that girl just now

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,540
Did you see something?

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,540
Will she call the police?

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:08,740
Keep your voice down

6
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,900
Afraid that others don’t know

7
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,980
Has the baby been bitten?

8
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,100
If she knew

9
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,420
Don't be scared to the point of screaming

10
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,420
Didn’t they just enter the house directly?

11
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,140
What if she saw it?

12
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,580
What to do if you call the police

13
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,420
Xiaobao will be taken away

14
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,580
All the people who were bitten were taken away, mom

15
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:27,780
Let's send Xiaobao away. Shut up.

16
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,330
Don't talk nonsense

17
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:39,580
The world is really going to hell
